{"c":"473052","n":"MORAVICE 2","t":"P","s":"MS","o":"Opava","url":"473052-moravice-2","stav":"2026-10-09","popis":"GPS Z: 49°51'36.951\"N, 17°51'41.962\"E, K: 49°48'33.292\"N, 17°47'57.162\"E\nPřítok Opavy, Odry. Od jezu pod Žimrovicemi až po bývalý jez nad dřevěným mostem ve Větřkovicích včetně Papírenského náhonu (Weisshuhnův kanál) GPS Z: 49°51'37.611\"N,  17°51'38.303\"E,  K: 49°49'53.475\"N,17°49'54.108\"E na papírnu Žimrovice, který je chovný – lov ryb zakázán. Přítoky jsou chovné – lov ryb zakázán.\nNejmenší lovná míra pstruha obecného je zvýšena na 30 cm.\nV úseku od jezu Papírenského náhonu (Weisshuhnova kanálu) až po bývalý jez nad dřevěným mostem ve Větřkovicích je pstruh obecný celoročně hájen.","delka":12,"rozloha":18,"lat":49.834847,"lon":17.830167,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/opava","mo_tel":"","mo_mail":"opava@mocrs.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30"